#
# Daemons init(8) starts, supervises and restarts in multi-user mode.
#
# command [args ...]	uid:gid	chroot	policy
#
# init forks each command, so the command stays in the foreground. With a
# chroot directory the command path resolves inside it. uid and gid are
# numeric. policy is backoff (1 s doubling to 60 s between restarts) or
# capped (5 s between restarts, disabled until SIGHUP after 6). kill -HUP 1
# rereads this file.
#
# update needs no privilege: sync(2) has no root check. /var/update holds
# only a hard link to /usr/sbin/update.
/update -f	1:1	/var/update	backoff
